RE the other error: if you remove the "subnet" graph-level attribute it should run without error.

for (i in 1:2) {
  for (j in 1:2) {
    g[[i]]$graph[[j]]$subnet <- NULL
  }
}

I will fix this with the next bugfix release as well.

Chris

